<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        color: #333;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      .email-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
      }

      .header {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 20px;
        background-color: #1a73e8;
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 24px;
      }

      .content {
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: left;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .button-container {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 20px 0;
      }

      .button {
        background-color: #1a73e8 !important;
        color: white !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 18px;
        padding: 12px 20px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        display: inline-block;
        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;
        font-weight: bold;
        border: none;
        text-align: center;
        width: auto;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .button:hover {
        background-color: #1558b2 !important;
      }

      .footer {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #888;
      }

      .bold {
        font-weight: bold;
      }

      .highlight {
        color: #1a73e8;
        font-weight: bold;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-container">
      <div class="header">
        Welcome to Virtual Job Fair
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <% if @resource.recruiter? && @resource.confirmed_at.present? %>
          <!-- Career Officer Approval Email -->
          <p class="bold">Hello Career Officer,</p>
          <p>As a <span class="highlight">Career Officer</span>, your role is to ensure that recruiters joining the Virtual Job Fair Platform are legitimate and aligned with our standards. A new recruiter requires your approval:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Recruiter Name:</strong> <%= @resource.full_name %></li>
            <li><strong>Company Name:</strong> <%= @resource.recruiter_profile.company_name %></li>
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> <%= @resource.email %></li>
          </ul>
          <p>Please review the details above and click the button below to approve this recruiter:</p>
          <div class="button-container">
            <a href="<%= confirm_recruiter_url(approval_token: @resource.generate_approval_token) %>" class="button">
              Approve Recruiter
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>If you have any concerns about this request or find the information unclear, please <strong>ignore this email</strong> or contact the company directly for verification.</p>
        <% elsif @resource.recruiter? %>
          <!-- Recruiter Confirmation Email -->
          <p class="bold">Welcome, <span class="highlight"><%= @resource.full_name %></span>!</p>
          <p>Thank you for signing up for the <strong>Virtual Job Fair Platform</strong> as a <span class="highlight">Recruiter</span>. Your role is vital in connecting talented students with exciting career opportunities. Once your account is approved by a Career Officer, you will gain access to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Post job openings and internships.</li>
            <li>Connect with highly qualified students.</li>
            <li>Participate in virtual career fairs and networking events.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To complete your registration, please confirm your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
          <div class="button-container">
            <a href="<%= confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token) %>" class="button">
              Confirm Account
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>If you did not request this, please disregard this email.</p>
        <% elsif @resource.career_officer? %>
          <!-- Career Officer Confirmation Email -->
          <p class="bold">Welcome, <span class="highlight"><%= @resource.full_name %></span>!</p>
          <p>Thank you for signing up for the <strong>Virtual Job Fair Platform</strong> as a <span class="highlight">Career Officer</span>. Your role is crucial in ensuring the quality and legitimacy of recruiters on our platform. You will have access to tools and resources to review and approve recruiter profiles.</p>
          <p>To complete your registration, please confirm your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
          <div class="button-container">
            <a href="<%= confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token) %>" class="button">
              Confirm Account
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>If you did not request this, please disregard this email.</p>
        <% else %>
          <!-- Student Confirmation Email -->
          <p class="bold">Welcome, <span class="highlight"><%= @resource.full_name %></span>!</p>
          <p>Thank you for signing up for the <strong>Virtual Job Fair Platform</strong>. As a <span class="highlight">Student</span>, you will have access to job opportunities, career resources, and networking events tailored to help you succeed.</p>
          <p>To complete your registration, please confirm your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
          <div class="button-container">
            <a href="<%= confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @token) %>" class="button">
              Confirm Account
            </a>
          </div>
          <p>If you did not request this, please disregard this email.</p>
        <% end %>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        &copy; 2025 Virtual Job Fair Platform. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>